ITEM B42 — 24-Hour True Daily Extremes & ETo Non-Degeneracy
-----------------------------------------------------------
1. Implementation:
   - Abandoned instantaneous proxy snapshots. Fetched full 24-hour hourly series from WeatherBench-2 ERA5.
   - True daily extremes: Tmax = max(T_h), Tmin = min(T_h), Tmean = mean(T_h).
2. Physical Verification:
   - Minimum diurnal range TD in Monsoon (2017-07-15): 1.22 °C (strictly > 0 everywhere).
   - Minimum diurnal range TD in Pre-Monsoon (2018-04-30): 0.90 °C (strictly > 0 everywhere).
   - The Hargreaves-Samani sqrt(TD) term never degenerates. The 0.00 mm/day floor is eliminated:
     * In-window Monsoon downscaled ETo range: [1.71, 5.29] mm/day (mean = 2.98 mm/day).
     * In-window Pre-Monsoon downscaled ETo range: [1.79, 7.83] mm/day (mean = 5.85 mm/day).


