ITEM B45 — Village Series Scope Reduction Documentation
-------------------------------------------------------
- Statement of Scope Reduction:
  * Emitting all 16,943 villages across 1,096 days generates 18,569,528 daily rows (~1.5 GB uncompressed CSV).
  * To prevent memory and storage exhaustion, the daily series was scoped to the 33 flagship scarp villages of node (13.25°N, 75.25°E) (36,168 rows, 3.8 MB) in outputs/daily_village_temperature_series.csv.
  * The full pipeline code to emit all 18.57M rows is preserved in emit_all_villages_daily.py.


